casebook sump_pump_manual-draft v1
source "sump_pump_manual.txt" dated 2026-10-11 by "drafted by qwen2.5:14b (temperature 0.7, seed 7) from the manual; not yet approved"
note "UNAPPROVED DRAFT: written by a language model from sump_pump_manual.txt. Every declaration below cites the sentence"
note "it came from. Check each against the manual, add what the manual does not say, then delete"
note "this note to approve. quorum studio will not build a chip image while it is here."

# manual: "When the float switch is open and no other signal is present, the pump is idle and no action is needed."
observe high_water_off "water level below high-water mark"

# manual: "The high-water float switch closes when the water in the pit is above the high-water mark."
observe high_water_on "water level above high-water mark"

# manual: "The motor current relay closes when the motor is drawing running current."
observe current_on "motor drawing current"

# manual: "The discharge flow switch closes when water is moving in the discharge pipe."
observe flow_on "water moving in discharge pipe"

# manual: "The thermal switch in the motor winding opens when the winding is overheated."
observe thermal_off "motor overheated"

# manual: "Water cannot move in the discharge pipe unless the motor is drawing current."
implies flow_on current_on "water cannot move without current"

# manual: "If the high-water float switch is closed and the motor current relay is not closed, the pump has failed to start and the pit may overflow."
claim failed_to_start "pump failed to start" severity 5 needs high_water_on

# manual: "When the float switch is open and no other signal is present, the pump is idle and no action is needed."
claim idle "pump is idle and no action is needed" severity 1 needs high_water_off

# manual: "If the discharge flow switch is closed while the motor current relay is open, one of the two instruments is faulty and both must be inspected."
doubt instruments_faulty "instrument malfunction" needs flow_on
  undermines current_on

# manual: "If the thermal switch has opened, the motor is overheated and the pump must be stopped."
claim overheating "motor overheating" severity 7 needs thermal_off

# manual: "If the motor current relay is closed and the discharge flow switch is not closed, the pump is running dry or the discharge is blocked."
claim dry_run "pump running dry or discharge blocked" severity 6 needs current_on

# manual: "Running dry destroys the shaft seal within minutes, so the pump must be stopped."
claim dry_run_hazardous "running dry is hazardous" severity 8 needs dry_run

# manual: "While the weekly test is in progress, running with no discharge flow is expected and is not a fault."
flow_on rebuts dry_run

# manual: "When the high-water float switch is closed, the pump should be running."
action keep_running idle

# manual: "The pump must be stopped."
action stop_pump safe when any dry_run instruments_faulty thermal_off

# manual: "Stopping the pump takes priority over reporting to maintenance, and reporting to maintenance takes priority over normal running."
prefer stop_pump over keep_running
